 "  Advanced Lesson 11 "
}], "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f8d4368e-9b8f-4340-bcf2-52b24b973636"],

Cell["\<\
Your Name:  Mikey Ferguson

Your Math Class:  MATH 7013 - Advanced Mathematical Modeling\
\>", "Program",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.390368232619*^9, 3.3903682391219997`*^9}, {
   3.390368866851*^9, 3.390368908736*^9}, {3.3903690435030003`*^9, 
   3.390369082222*^9}, 3.3903880065649595`*^9},
 FontSize->16,
 FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"70a141b4-5841-4d56-b6c8-edde152497df"],

Cell[" Pattern matching in functional arguments:", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8599df3c-5a78-4028-adf3-48968a970dc3"],

Cell["\<\
When you are instructed to construct a function whose argument will match \
exactly one arbitrary object, you will write:   f[ x_ ]
 If you want delayed assignment to that function you will write:   f[ x_ ]  \
:=  rhs[ x ]\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"28323ab7-319b-4aad-8035-cc98f50da408"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "1: Write a delayed assignment function of exactly one argument which will \
square the argument.\n\tEvaluate:   ? f\n\tEvaluate:   f[2]\n\tEvaluate:   \
f[x]\n\tEvaluate:   f[y]\t\t",
 StyleBox["\[DoubleLongRightArrow] ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   SuperscriptBox["y", "2"],
   FontWeight->"Bold"]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5eee3d59-6a07-4604-b75f-c60927f161fb"],
 "\n\tEvaluate:   f[\"string\"]\n\tEvaluate:   f[ {1,2,3} ]\n\tEvaluate:   f[ \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", "\[NegativeThinSpace]", GridBox[{
      {"1", "2"},
      {"3", "4"}
     }], "\[NegativeThinSpace]", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a0421c5a-e7f2-4f67-813b-9f40a8260585"],
 " ]\t\t",
 StyleBox["\[DoubleLongRightArrow] ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "{{1,4},{9,16}}",
 "\n\tEvaluate:   f[ ]\n\tEvaluate:   f[ x,y ]\n\tEvaluate:   f[ 1,2,3,4 ]\n \
Explain what is different about the last three evaluations."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"96773478-d2b6-4094-8a60-6656eb82133e"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
   RowBox[{"f", ",", "x", ",", "y"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"f", "[", "x_", "]"}], ":=", 
  SuperscriptBox["x", "2"]}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"a0f82562-34fc-48c0-\
8363-b0564d54e27f"],

Cell["?f", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"59753426-e2ab-4a61-abbe-73bea4bcc3ba"],

