Cell["\<\
x__ means one or more arguments, and {x}^2 squares the list of them. Power \
has the attribute Listable, which means it applies elementwise, so {1,2,3}^2 \
is {1,4,9}. The last call, f[ ], fails because __ requires at least one \
argument.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2d868a5b-a5b5-4333-a8c5-eedbb133ad4c"],

