Cell["\<\
f[x_, y_] needs exactly two arguments. The first five calls supply zero, one \
or four, or supply a single list where two separate things were wanted, so \
none of them match.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7eab78b2-d6f6-460c-b078-3d17f97969f3"],

Cell["\<\
6: Part 1: Write a delayed assignment function of exactly THREE arguments \
which equals the list of those three arguments.
 Part 2: Write a delayed assignment function of exactly FOUR arguments which \
equals the list of those four arguments.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cfeb3e09-a939-4265-af9f-d0fdc4469b6e"],

