Cell["\<\
The rule matches any cube. In this version (1/2 + y)^3 is matched as well and \
becomes (1/2 + y)^333. The exercise expects it to be missed, but the full \
form is Power[Plus[Rational[1,2], y], 3], with a plain 3 in the exponent, so \
it fits the pattern.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7f24f521-1738-4654-b9e4-c2bb0fc07874"],

